WEBVTT

00:00:00.970 --> 00:00:04.039
Husky's 4.5× over MLX is speculative decoding.

00:00:04.039 --> 00:00:05.793
The method is published.

00:00:05.793 --> 00:00:09.301
The baseline was not given its own draft.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:15.582
1.40× the memory bus caps any one-token-per-read engine over MLX.

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:19.935
Median over MLX across sixteen tasks.

00:00:19.935 --> 00:00:24.449
Husky, no draft, 1.125×; Flash draft on, 1.76×.

00:00:24.449 --> 00:00:30.656
Without a draft, Husky ties MLX on seven of sixteen rows.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:35.122
Rows in the published table that reach 4.48×.

00:00:35.122 --> 00:00:38.029
1 of 16: function edit, Flash on.

00:00:38.029 --> 00:00:40.105
The reply copies the prompt.

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:45.766
Quote the median, not the maximum: 1.76× is a good result.

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:53.108
Every number here is from the full article, with its sources, at ai.thesatyajit.com.
